   - HERO: Mosqinux Killamp via MaxWeb tracker ($40 CPA). ✅ APPROVED + live
     link in place. ⚠️ NO BRAND BIDDING — never bid "Mosqinux" in Google Ads.
   ⚠️ STILL NEEDED BEFORE PAID TRAFFIC: US Amazon Associates tag (currently
     thelifeinside-20), real ASINs for ranks 2-5, and verified live ratings.
   - AMAZON: real product URLs + Sam's Associates tag + &ascsubtag= subid.
   RATINGS/COUNTS below are realistic but ⚠️ VERIFY LIVE on Amazon before
   publish. Mosqinux is sold direct (no Amazon aggregate) → scored on our
   disclosed assessment; shows real specs in place of a review count.
   ⚠️⚠️ US AMAZON DATA IS UNVERIFIED — DO NOT DRIVE PAID TRAFFIC YET.
   Amazon geo-redirects amazon.com -> amazon.com.au from this machine, so US
   ratings/review counts below are ESTIMATES, not verified US figures. One ASIN
   (B00004RALL) turned out to be a Weber grill, so all unverified deep-links
   were replaced with tagged Amazon SEARCH links (always land on the right
   product, still earn commission). TO FINISH: Sam sends real amazon.com
   product links w/ tag thelifeinside-20 -> restore deep-links, real titles,
   verified ratings, and product images.
   ========================================================================= */
/* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
   CPV ONE TRACKING — Mosqinux = campaign 7 (HauSafe is campaign 5).

   NOTE ON engsec: CPV One issues "engsec": "5" for BOTH campaigns — it is an
   account-level token, NOT the campaign id. Only checkdirect(7, 1) identifies
   this campaign. Do not "fix" engsec to 7; that would break tracking.

   Google Ads Final URL suffix for the Mosqinux campaign (set at CAMPAIGN level,
   not account level — clpcid=7 is campaign-specific):
     keyword={keyword}&ad={creative}&match={matchtype}&network={network}&campid={campaignid}&adgroupid={adgroupid}&clpcid=7

   base2.php is CPV One's session-based landing-page → offer redirect: landing.js
   sets the campaign context via checkdirect(7, 1), then base2.php resolves to the
   offer configured for campaign 7. That is why it carries no query string.
   --------------------------------------------------------------------------- */
const CPV_ROOT = "https://track.thelifeinsider.com/";
const CPV_ENGSEC = "5"; // account-level token — same for every campaign
const CPV_CAMPAIGN = "7"; // Mosqinux
const CPV_REDIRECT = "base2.php";

const MOSQINUX_DIRECT = "https://mwebtrackerhq.com/8293/3526/2/?subid=zapper_hero";
const MOSQINUX_LINK =
  CPV_CAMPAIGN && CPV_REDIRECT ? `${CPV_ROOT}${CPV_REDIRECT}` : MOSQINUX_DIRECT; // hero, $40/sale — NO BRAND BIDDING
// Sam's live amazon.com Associates links (tag thelifeinside-20), ASINs + linkIds verified.
const AMZ = (asin: string, linkId: string, sub: string) =>
  `https://www.amazon.com/dp/${asin}?linkCode=ll2&tag=thelifeinside-20&linkId=${linkId}&language=en_US&ref_=as_li_ss_tl&ascsubtag=zapper_${sub}`;

