  {
    q: "Zapper or trap — what's the difference?",
    a: "A zapper uses an electrified grid to kill insects on contact (often with a faint snap), while a trap draws them in with light and a fan and holds them on a sticky board or in a basket, silently. Traps are quieter and better indoors; zappers cover more ground outdoors. Our list includes the best of each so you can match the device to your space.",
  },
  {
    q: "How do you rate these products?",
    a: "Our Insider Score weighs verified customer ratings (50%), review volume and consistency (20%), value for money (15%), and brand reliability (15%). For direct-sold products without a retailer review aggregate, we're transparent that the score reflects our assessment of design, coverage, and value rather than an aggregated rating. See our full <a href='/how-we-rate/'>methodology</a>.",
  },
];
---

<ReviewPage
  title="The 5 Best Mosquito Zappers & Insect Traps of 2026 [Compared] | The Life Insider"
  description="We compared the top chemical-free mosquito zappers and insect traps on coverage, how they work, verified ratings, and value. See which one ranked #1 for 2026."
  h1="The 5 Best Mosquito Zappers & Insect Traps of 2026"
  updated="July 2026"
  intro={intro}
  products={products}
  keyFindings={keyFindings}
  deepDive={deepDive}
  faqs={faqs}
>
  {/* CPV One landing-page tracking — only emitted once the campaign id is set,
      so a half-configured tracker can never silently mis-log to HauSafe. */}
  {CPV_CAMPAIGN && (
    <Fragment slot="body-end">
      <script is:inline set:html={`var clpconfig = { "clroot": "${CPV_ROOT}", "engsec": "${CPV_ENGSEC}" };`} />
      <script is:inline src={`${CPV_ROOT}landing.js`}></script>
      <script is:inline set:html={`checkdirect(${CPV_CAMPAIGN}, 1)`} />
    </Fragment>
  )}
</ReviewPage>
